1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,389
Drink this,

2
00:00:01,439 --> 00:00:02,130
and you will

3
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,629
never die.

4
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,449
He said yes.

5
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:07,209
Five hundred

6
00:00:07,259 --> 00:00:08,629
years ago.

7
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:09,849
He has read

8
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,529
every book.

9
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,969
Seen every sunrise.

10
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:15,429
Learned every language.

11
00:00:16,019 --> 00:00:18,429
But everyone he loved…

12
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,270
grew old.

13
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,269
One by one,

14
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:23,290
their lights went out.

15
00:00:23,899 --> 00:00:24,929
Maybe an ending

16
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:25,849
is what makes

17
00:00:25,899 --> 00:00:27,510
each day count.

18
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,789
Or maybe forever

19
00:00:28,839 --> 00:00:29,929
is just more time

20
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:30,330
to love again.

21
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:35,190
So…

22
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,100
would you drink it?

